5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Hello everyone. To ensure we plan this camp responsibly, we need to establish a clear understanding of the financial and logistical constraints. I suggest we begin by analyzing the available data before proposing any destinations.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I agree. Jumping into suggestions without a logical basis is a waste of time. Let's be calculating about this; we need to see the actual conditions and costs before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Hi everyone! I'm looking forward to the camp. I agree that we should be careful, but I also want to make sure everyone has a good time and feels happy. What should we look at first?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Asuka and Shion. We need a precise understanding of the costs and logistics to avoid any financial surprises. Let's start by examining the data to ensure we can set a sustainable budget.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm in! Let's get this moving. I don't want another boring camp where everyone just sticks to their own groups. We need a place that actually forces us to bond and get to know each other!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"To address my concerns regarding financial fairness and risk, I will look into the ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and the ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets."" I want to see how costs are actually distributed.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'll examine the ""Prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds"" and the ""Canteen closure and last year's cooking duty."" I want to understand the actual living conditions and the daily workload to avoid any inefficiency.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I want to know if the people who organized it before were okay! I'll check the ""Canteen closure and last year's cooking duty"" and the ""Lottery and application for public group bookings"" to see how much work it is.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I will also check the ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and the ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets."" I want to be absolutely certain about the actual expenses to prevent any budget deficits this year.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'll check ""What the seniors say about year-groups mixing"" and the ""Attendance sheets for the away camps."" I want to know why people didn't mingle last time and who actually showed up!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Since Misaki is researching the same documents as I am, we can compare our findings later. I believe this will help us identify any hidden costs or inconsistencies in how the budget was handled previously.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Comparing notes is a useful tactic for some, but I prefer to analyze my data independently first. I'm more interested in whether the facilities are actually viable or just a logistical nightmare in disguise.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I hope we can all find things that make us feel relaxed. @Shion, do you think the cooking duty is very hard? I'm a bit worried that the people in charge might get too tired.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, yes, comparing notes will be efficient. I want to ensure we have a precise picture of the financial history so we don't repeat past mistakes with the budget. Let's see what the data reveals.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, I'm sure it's tough, but we can handle it if we work together! I'm more worried about the vibe. If we just pick the easiest place, we'll end up in the same cliques again. Let's find some real answers!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Let us proceed with our respective research. I will focus on the financial risks and the terms of the lets to ensure we have a fair and stable plan. I look forward to the results.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I will focus on the physical and operational realities. If the sleeping arrangements are subpar or the labor is excessive, the camp's quality will suffer regardless of the budget. I'll see you all in the next round.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll do my best to find out how much work it takes to organize everything. I want to make sure nobody has to do too much on their own. See you all soon!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will begin my research now. I want to ensure we have a precise understanding of the financial history and the terms of the lets to avoid any shortfalls. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready! I'm going to find out exactly why the last camp was such a fail for the club's spirit. Let's get the data and then pick a place that actually brings us together! See ya!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
